# [EN] Field label (on the left side of the control, doesn't need to be larger than body text, just
# [EN] slightly larger than the hint)
# [EN] Prompt / description
# [EN] Body description
# [EN] —— 16 and body text 15 differ by only 1px, they look like the same thing; only at 17 does it
# [EN] stand up.
# [EN] Dialog title
# [EN] Button height (slightly taller than the control, so the click area isn't too thin)
# [EN] Button text (same size as the control body text, looks like a set)

