        #  ⚠ 只留 `LLM_TURNS_MAX` 发（几万字的 prompt，留一整天会吃光内存）。
        # [EN] **The last few LLM exchanges** (what the status pill's dialog shows).
        # [EN] ★ 2026-10-24 (the user's second version): "show what was sent to the LLM and what it
