        # [EN] (so you can scroll up), not "the latest one".
        # [EN] ⚠ `resp` accumulates from `delta` events, which is why it grows bit by bit in the dialog.
        # [EN] ⚠ Only `LLM_TURNS_MAX` entries (prompts run to tens of thousands of characters; a whole
